file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_print_scan.sh ceiling 6900 -> 4800, and the fold's prose brought current beside the elder numbers kept in the past tense
file tools/caravan_ladder_print_witness.rish every asserted figure moved to what the scan now prints, and the widened neighbor agreement named rather than hidden
