recommend keep-going the last whole body of the printing family is `tell_the_reopener` -- 48 lines in 11 rungs, 528 carried lines, and the same shape this lap proved. Verify its reach as `pub` across all 11 first, exactly as this lap did, and expect its own tier accessor (`recount_of`) to want the same one-word widening. After that the whole-body carry is spent and what remains is the staircase of per-tier bodies, which wants a different fold than either half of this one.
